# LeakSanitizer's exceptions for the linux-asan presets (LSAN_OPTIONS in CMakePresets.json).
#
# fontconfig's own configuration, and the character sets Slint's font fallback asks it for: made
# once, the first time a process lays out text on Linux, and held for the rest of its life, since
# nothing ends fontconfig. 544 bytes in nine allocations in every test that draws a window, and
# never more; every frame of each report is fontconfig, expat or Slint's fontconfig backend.
leak:libfontconfig.so
